### 4. Third-Party Services & Analytics
- No Third-Party Tracking SDKs: We do not embed analytics SDKs (such as Google Analytics, Firebase Analytics, Facebook SDK, AppsFlyer) that track your behavior.
- No Advertising Networks: CleanMyPhone does not contain third-party ad networks or data brokers.
- No Remote Telemetry: We do not collect crash logs or diagnostic reports containing personally identifiable information.

---

### 5. Data Retention & Deletion
- Zero Cloud Storage: Because we do not upload or store any data on external servers, we hold no user data on our infrastructure.
- User-Initiated File Deletion: When you delete duplicate photos, junk caches, or large files using CleanMyPhone, they are deleted directly from your device storage immediately.
- App Uninstall / Data Clearing: Clearing app data or uninstalling CleanMyPhone permanently removes all local settings, scan caches, and app preferences.

---

### 6. Security Safeguards
- Safe Cleanup Basket: All files marked for cleanup are queued in a review basket before any permanent deletion occurs, preventing accidental data loss.
- Local Sandbox Storage: App configurations and cached metadata are stored within the protected Android application sandbox directory.
- Modern Android Hardening: Android 16/15/14 modern scoped storage guidelines, hardened R8/ProGuard obfuscation, and zero exported sensitive components.

